  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enterprise Development Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UDEC will work with Cooperativa Cosechando Juntos lo Sembrado, S.C. (CSJ), to provide business training and technical assistance to 500 backyard gardeners and 125 rural microentrepeneurs selling food, clothing, soaps and shampoos and crafts in 40 communities of Queretaro. The program also offers them access to credit through savings-and- loan associations.</narrative>
  </description>
